{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>這張海報並不代表影片與《GTA6》已經展開內容聯動，而是電影宣傳活動對熱門流行文化作品的一次戲仿。</p>\n<p>《憤怒的小鳥3大電影》此前也在持續採用類似的惡搞營銷方式。現有信息尚未確認這張海報是否獲得Rockstar授權。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"派拉蒙發佈《憤怒的小鳥3大電影》海報 視覺模仿《GTA6》\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261118/1794994381_602963.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:44:10.213908+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":1,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T10:07:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T05:37:19.212101+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T10:37:17.518784+00:00","content_hash":"2ba67962ab61ace6744b46caeb1207c0a5eaee0d7b1064a49df0f012a216cb66","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}